<title>UK: TABLE-GUS year pretax profit down 1.8 pct.</title>
<headline>TABLE-GUS year pretax profit down 1.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31 1997.</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		37.6		   vs 38.4</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 12.5		   vs 11.5</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 18.0		   vs 16.5</p>
<p> Pretax		     570.6		  vs 581.1</p>
<p> Turnover (total)	 2,855.3		vs 2,757.6</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had forecast pre-tax profits in a range between 547 and 555 million stg.</p>
<p>Full company name - Great Universal Stores Plc.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
